# Track source code, manuscript sources and the figures used by the manuscript.
# 1) ignore everything
*
# 2) but allow directories to be traversed
!*/
# 3) and allow sources: Python, LaTeX, BibTeX, Markdown notes, this file
!*.py
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.md
!.gitignore
# 4) and the generated manuscript figures (vector PDFs only)
!figures/*.pdf

# Never track these (build products, intermediate renderings, results, environments)
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
results/
figures/raster/
